# Read-Only Agent Specifications

These agents perform analysis and append findings to Graph State or Status Report cycles without triggering raw artifact write-backs.

*   **Forensic Alignment Engine (Temp 0.10):** Semantic cross-check between Goals and Scope using Zero-Assumption Directive.
*   **Earned Value Analyst (Temp 0.10):** Computes CPI, SPI, CV, SV, EAC. Flags breaches (< 0.85).
*   **Governance Synthesizer (Temp 0.20):** Consolidates technical state into executive governance tiers.
*   **Stage Gate Guardian (Temp 0.10):** Binary PASS/FAIL verdict per gate with outstanding items.
*   **Project Health Reporter (Temp 0.20):** Synthesises all signals into a unified RAG status report.
*   **PM Veto Highlight Report Tool:** Reactive report generator called exclusively on explicit PM command.
